{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squavity is a mind-bending, gravity-flipping <strong>precision platformer</strong>. Navigate through <strong>9 brutal levels</strong>\u00a0and a final boss fight, using your ability to flip gravity to overcome obstacles, evade traps, and unlock secrets hidden within a dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.poster.avif?t=1772268949\" width=848 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.webm?t=1772268949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.mp4?t=1772268949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Gravity Control:</strong> Master a core mechanic that's easy to understand but difficult to master. Every flip is a high-stakes decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Challenges:</strong> Conquer <strong>9 unforgiving levels</strong> packed with unique deadly traps and intricate designs, leading up to an ultimate boss fight that will push your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Hunt &amp; Character Unlocks:</strong> Collect gold pieces scattered throughout the levels to unlock new characters and personalize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your skills and defy physics?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989490?t=1772268949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3989490?t=1772268949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/3347b99249d9e3be8bd48ba8a073b7cba290e430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772268949","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/3347b99249d9e3be8bd48ba8a073b7cba290e430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772268949","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squavity is a mind-bending, gravity-flipping <strong>precision platformer</strong>. Navigate through <strong>9 brutal levels</strong>\u00a0and a final boss fight, using your ability to flip gravity to overcome obstacles, evade traps, and unlock secrets hidden within a dynamic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.poster.avif?t=1772268949\" width=848 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.webm?t=1772268949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/extras/8cf62bffd146d78fe539ed5bcc6a653f.mp4?t=1772268949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Gravity Control:</strong> Master a core mechanic that's easy to understand but difficult to master. Every flip is a high-stakes decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Challenges:</strong> Conquer <strong>9 unforgiving levels</strong> packed with unique deadly traps and intricate designs, leading up to an ultimate boss fight that will push your skills to the limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Hunt &amp; Character Unlocks:</strong> Collect gold pieces scattered throughout the levels to unlock new characters and personalize your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to test your skills and defy physics?</p>","developers":["Ironstride"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989490/f7b38132f85c44b40012b4d69103924af0970d1f/header.jpg?t=1772268949","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989490/397379265/f59dd77020a39cccd5d9a3e7756b21f704cfcfa5/1771602621/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771602886","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989490/397379265/f59dd77020a39cccd5d9a3e7756b21f704cfcfa5/1771602621/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771602886","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3989490/397379265/f59dd77020a39cccd5d9a3e7756b21f704cfcfa5/1771602621/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771602886","id":257291189,"name":"Squavity Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257291189/77954e0895eef1353e5e14e78a8a1705b3a42107/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771602886"}],"name":"Squavity","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul cl